# Per-card cargo output roots (TRUNK_CARD; see docs/build-environment.md).
# Cargo's own /src-tauri/target is ignored by src-tauri/.gitignore, and these
# are the same build output under a different name, so they need the same
# exclusion — untracked, they swamp every tool that walks the tree.
/src-tauri/target-cards

# The measurement bridge writes its per-run token here (just measure)
scripts/measure/.bridge-token.txt
